{"title":"EXOTIC WOODS COLLECTION","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExotic Woods Collection\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a celebration of nature's rarest and most captivating timbers, transformed into extraordinary custom cues through master craftsmanship.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEach cue is handcrafted from carefully selected exotic hardwoods, prized for their distinctive grain patterns, rich natural colors, and exceptional character. From dramatic burl figures to elegant straight grains, no two cues are ever exactly alike—making every piece a one-of-a-kind creation.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"tri-cut-spalted-tamarind-custom-cue-with-torrefied-maple-shaft","title":"Tri-Cut Spalted Tamarind Custom Cue with Torrefied Maple Shaft","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eCrafted for players who appreciate both performance and artistry, this custom cue blends premium materials with precision craftsmanship. The striking \u003cstrong\u003etri-cut Spalted Tamarind handle\u003c\/strong\u003e showcases the natural beauty of exotic wood, while the \u003cstrong\u003eEbony forearm and butt sleeve\u003c\/strong\u003e provide timeless elegance and exceptional durability. Finished with shimmering \u003cstrong\u003eabalone inlays\u003c\/strong\u003e, every cue is handcrafted to stand out on and off the table.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt for a smooth, consistent hit, it features a \u003cstrong\u003eTorrefied Maple shaft\u003c\/strong\u003e that offers increased stability, reduced deflection, and excellent feedback. Combined with a \u003cstrong\u003eJuma ferrule\u003c\/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eBlack Diamond tip\u003c\/strong\u003e, this cue delivers exceptional cue ball control, spin, and accuracy.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOverall Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 59 inches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 19 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ebony\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHandle:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tri-Cut Spalted Tamarind\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ebony\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInlays:\u003c\/strong\u003e Genuine Abalone\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eShaft:\u003c\/strong\u003e Torrefied Maple\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTip Diameter:\u003c\/strong\u003e 12.5 mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTaper:\u003c\/strong\u003e Pro Taper\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFerrule:\u003c\/strong\u003e Juma\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTip:\u003c\/strong\u003e Black Diamond\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHandcrafted using premium exotic hardwoods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBeautiful tri-cut Spalted Tamarind handle with unique natural grain\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eElegant abalone inlays for a luxurious finish\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStable Torrefied Maple shaft for a crisp, consistent hit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrecision-machined radial pin for a solid, reliable joint connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmooth pro taper for effortless stroke and cue ball control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt for serious players who demand performance without compromising style\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEvery Cues Master cue is individually handcrafted, making each piece one of a kind. The natural wood grain ensures no two cues are ever exactly alike.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43445513715760,"sku":null,"price":45000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/ChatGPTImageJul30_2026_08_22_24PM.png?v=1785414159"},{"product_id":"spalted-tamarind-cue","title":"Spalted Tamarind X Maple (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eElevate your game with this handcrafted \u003cstrong\u003eCues Master Custom Cue\u003c\/strong\u003e, featuring a striking \u003cstrong\u003espalted tamarind wood\u003c\/strong\u003e that showcases expert craftsmanship and timeless elegance. The combination of figured maple and vibrant resin creates a cue that stands out both in appearance and performance.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 15.5 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5 inches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial Pin\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e Maple with abalone and plastic ivory points\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHandle:\u003c\/strong\u003e spalted tamarind wood\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Maple with abalone and plastic ivory points\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign:\u003c\/strong\u003e spalted tamarind and long points construction with precision craftsmanship\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt for players who appreciate both beauty and playability, this cue offers a solid, consistent hit thanks to its radial pin construction, while the spalted tamarind wood highlights the artistry behind every handcrafted piece. Whether you're competing or adding to your collection, this cue delivers exceptional style and dependable performance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43450866663472,"sku":null,"price":30000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/ChatGPT_Image_Aug_2_2026_06_01_55_PM.png?v=1785664936"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/collections\/ChatGPTImageJul30_2026_08_22_24PM.png?v=1785896111","url":"https:\/\/cuesmastershop.com\/collections\/exotic-woods.oembed","provider":"Cues Master Shop","version":"1.0","type":"link"}